sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 🤖 agent
    participant N as 🔔 check nudge
    participant C as 🔍 critic
    participant G as 🛡️ trim guard
    A->>N: done, with code added and no check
    N-->>A: leave one runnable check (asked once)
    A->>A: adds a few asserts under if __name__
    A->>C: done
    C-->>A: 1. shrink: functools.cache (net: -9 lines)<br/>2. delete: an unused counter (net: -3 lines)<br/>net: -12 lines
    A->>G: an edit that removes the cache class
    G-->>A: allowed: no guard was lost
    A->>G: an edit that also drops an input check
    G-->>A: refused: the file's guard count would fall
    A->>A: done, and the episode ends
    Note over A,G: smaller, with its check, every guard intact
